	(property "Description" "USB-C tap (T-plug): USB-C board F-F with receptacles IN and OUT and a USB-C plug board with 4 pads. Pads: 1 G (GND), 2 D+, 3 D-, 4 V (VBUS), 2.0mm pitch, THT wire points under the plug board's pads. Assembly 17.5 x 30.1mm. The bench wires G, D+ and D- to the IOmcu; V carries no wire. Scaled from an owner photo, about 0.5mm."
